[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":30,"col":13},"end":{"line":30,"col":20}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: every message of the program writes the whole model\nwith `f model`, a call of `f`, a function a pattern or a `let` binds, which the\ncompiler knows only as a value, so the compiler cannot tell which of the model's\nfields change (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 4). Write each\nchange in `update` itself — a message per change, each writing its fields — and\nthe bindings it reaches follow. The program is valid: it builds with\n`--platform=browser-tea`."}]
